       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    CMPMNT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  FIBERNET - COMPLAINT / SERVICE-REQUEST REGISTRATION            
      *  FUNCTION : A=log a new complaint, C=change status,            *
      *             I=inquiry, on CMPMAST.                              
      *             New complaint numbers come from CTLFILE (NXTCMP).   
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CMPMAST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CMPMAST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CMP-STS.
           SELECT CUSTMAST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CUSTMAST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CUST-STS.
           SELECT CTLFILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CTLFILE
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CTL-STS.
           SELECT DSPF ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-CMPMNTD-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CMPMAST  LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CMPMAST.
       FD  CUSTMAST LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CUSTMAST.
       FD  CTLFILE  LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CTLFILE.
       FD  DSPF     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CMPMNTD.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STATUS-FLAGS.
           05  WS-CMP-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-CUST-STS     PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-CTL-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-DSP-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-INDIC.
           05  EXIT-KEY        PIC 1 INDICATOR 03 VALUE B"0".
           05  CANCEL-KEY      PIC 1 INDICATOR 12 VALUE B"0".
       01  WS-FOUND-SW         PIC X(01) VALUE "N".
           88  REC-FOUND                 VALUE "Y".
           88  REC-NOTFOUND              VALUE "N".
       01  WS-NXTCMP           PIC 9(09) VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-CURR-DATE        PIC X(21).
       01  WS-TODAY            PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROS.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       000-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O   CMPMAST.
           OPEN INPUT CUSTMAST.
           OPEN I-O   CTLFILE.
           OPEN I-O   DSPF.
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-CURR-DATE.
           MOVE WS-CURR-DATE(1:8) TO WS-TODAY.
           PERFORM 100-PROCESS UNTIL EXIT-KEY = B"1".
           CLOSE CMPMAST CUSTMAST CTLFILE DSPF.
           GOBACK.

       100-PROCESS.
           MOVE SPACES TO MSGTXT.
           MOVE ZEROS  TO CMPNO OF CMPPMT.
           MOVE SPACES TO ACTION.
           WRITE CMPPMT.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 100-EXIT
           END-IF.
           EVALUATE ACTION
               WHEN "A"  PERFORM 200-ADD
               WHEN "C"  PERFORM 300-CHANGE
               WHEN "I"  PERFORM 500-INQUIRY
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE "Invalid action." TO MSGTXT
                   WRITE CMPPMT
                   READ DSPF
           END-EVALUATE.
       100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       200-ADD.
           INITIALIZE CMPDTL.
           MOVE "O" TO CMPSTS OF CMPDTL.
           WRITE CMPDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1" OR CANCEL-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 200-EXIT
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 700-VALIDATE-CUST.
           IF MSGTXT NOT = SPACES
               GO TO 200-EXIT
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 600-NEXT-CMPNO.
           INITIALIZE CMPREC.
           MOVE WS-NXTCMP TO CMPNO OF CMPREC.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING CMPDTL TO CMPREC.
           MOVE WS-TODAY TO CMPDT.
           MOVE "O"      TO CMPSTS OF CMPREC.
           MOVE ZEROS    TO RESLDT.
           WRITE CMPREC.
           IF WS-CMP-STS = "00"
               STRING "Complaint logged.  Number = " WS-NXTCMP
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO MSGTXT
           ELSE
               MOVE "Add failed - file error." TO MSGTXT
           END-IF.
       200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       300-CHANGE.
           MOVE CMPNO OF CMPPMT TO CMPNO OF CMPREC.
           PERFORM 400-READ-CMP.
           IF REC-NOTFOUND
               MOVE "Complaint not found." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 300-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING CMPREC TO CMPDTL.
           WRITE CMPDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1" OR CANCEL-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 300-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING CMPDTL TO CMPREC.
           IF CMPSTS OF CMPREC = "C" AND RESLDT = ZEROS
               MOVE WS-TODAY TO RESLDT
           END-IF.
           REWRITE CMPREC.
           IF WS-CMP-STS = "00"
               MOVE "Complaint updated." TO MSGTXT
           ELSE
               MOVE "Update failed." TO MSGTXT
           END-IF.
       300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       400-READ-CMP.
           READ CMPMAST
               INVALID KEY     SET REC-NOTFOUND TO TRUE
               NOT INVALID KEY SET REC-FOUND    TO TRUE
           END-READ.
       400-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       500-INQUIRY.
           MOVE CMPNO OF CMPPMT TO CMPNO OF CMPREC.
           PERFORM 400-READ-CMP.
           IF REC-NOTFOUND
               MOVE "Complaint not found." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 500-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING CMPREC TO CMPDTL.
           WRITE CMPDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           MOVE "End of inquiry." TO MSGTXT.
       500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       600-NEXT-CMPNO.
           MOVE "1" TO CTLID.
           READ CTLFILE
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE 1000 TO NXTCUST
                   MOVE 1    TO NXTBILL NXTPAY NXTCMP
                   WRITE CTLREC
           END-READ.
           MOVE NXTCMP TO WS-NXTCMP.
           ADD 1 TO NXTCMP.
           REWRITE CTLREC.
       600-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       700-VALIDATE-CUST.
           MOVE CCUSTID OF CMPDTL TO CUSTID.
           READ CUSTMAST
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE "Customer id does not exist." TO MSGTXT
           END-READ.
       700-EXIT.
           EXIT.
